  "description": "A Coast Guard Sector San Diego MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew medically evacuates a 47-year-old man from a tanker vessel approximately 150 miles south of San Diego, April 27, 2015. Watchstanders at Sector San Diego received a notification from the crew of the Hong Kong-flagged liquified petroleum gas tanker Touraine, that a crew member was suffering from possible kidney stones, and were requesting assistance. U.S. Coast Guard video/Sector San Diego and Air Station Sacramento.",
